<title>HONG KONG: COSCO Pacific 1996 net rises 63.3 pct.</title>
<headline>COSCO Pacific 1996 net rises 63.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   4.38   vs 4.21</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    9.0    vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    75.70  vs 46.36</p>
<p>    Turnover		     144.59 vs 124.08</p>
<p>    Company name		 COSCO Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 2-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   MAY 22</p>
<p>NOTE - China-owned container leasing firm COSCO Pacific is controlled by its largest customer, China Ocean Shipping (Group) Co (COSCO).</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 15 U.S. cents (including interim dividend of six cents) vs 14.28 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
